flowchart LR
    U[BA / PM / Stakeholder]
    WEB[React web application]
    MOBILE[Flutter mobile client\nimplemented · integration in progress]
    BE[ASP.NET Core backend\n.NET 10 · application services]

    U --> WEB
    U -.-> MOBILE
    WEB --> BE
    MOBILE -. current runtime partly mock-backed .-> BE

    BE --> DOMAIN[Identity · projects · documents\nmeetings · recordings · feedback]
    BE --> BDB[(Backend PostgreSQL / Neon)]
    BE --> BW[Backend analysis worker\ncombine text · submit · poll · persist]

    BW -->|POST /internal/process| AI[FastAPI AI service\ninternal jobs + compatibility API]
    BW -->|poll /internal/jobs/{jobId}| AI
    AI --> ADB[(AI PostgreSQL durable state)]
    AI --> Q[Redis / RQ]
    Q --> W[AI worker]
    W --> G[13-node LangGraph pipeline]
    G --> ART[(PostgreSQL / pgvector artifacts)]
    G -.-> PROVIDERS[Conditional chat · STT · embeddings]

    WEB -. explicit emergency fallback .-> AI
    AI -. optional callback capability .-> BE
